        <mxCell id="3B4_3ruLwvEKuvf9DDW0-6" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;1. Diagnosis&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Each SME (Subject Matter Expert) agent is given context based on single application (or not overlapping set of applications) logs, and metrics data. Each Agent is an &quot;expert&quot; on some fragment of the application.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;SME Agents are working to reach a consensus on what is happening in the system. We can employ many different mechanisms to achieve this.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;When consensus is reached a report is produced and forwarded to IC (Incident commander)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;SME Agents responsible for service applications may have access to the code repository.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;SME Agents responsible for infrastructure may have access to Kubernetes manifests codebase&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="471" y="800" width="639" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3B4_3ruLwvEKuvf9DDW0-8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="3B4_3ruLwvEKuvf9DDW0-7" target="kblwrcQaAgjI2Q_tANNS-1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
