        <mxCell id="3B4_3ruLwvEKuvf9DDW0-15" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;2. Planning remediation steps&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;IC (Incident commander) is responsible for planning, delegation, and coordination of remediation plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;produces a step-by-step plan that later is delegated to copy of SME agents - specialized to modify the codebase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;the plan may be taken under additional review process with SMEs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
