        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3B4_3ruLwvEKuvf9DDW0-27" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;3. Execution of plan&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The IC acts as the supervisor on plan execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;the SMEs introduce changes, and fixes in the codebase, and infrastructure according to plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;When the execution plan is finished CI/CD process runs. If the plan is not successful then the cycle repeats. Diagnosis -&amp;gt; Plan -&amp;gt; Execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="957" y="-80" width="639" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
